                              "content": "展開／收合：canvas 寬 ≥ 1200（沒開詳情窗）預設展開，否則收合成「需要你」一組（等於原 NeedsYouOverlay）；使用者切過就記 localStorage。",
                              "fontFamily": "Nunito",
                              "fontSize": 12,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            }
                          ]
